      <p class="eyebrow reveal">About</p>
      <h1 class="page-title" data-split style="--d:1">Hello, I’m <em>Sarah</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lead reveal" style="--d:2">Working primarily in oil and acrylic, I create contemporary abstract paintings inspired by the florals and landscapes of everyday life.</p>
      <p class="reveal">Through expressive colour, texture and movement, my work explores the relationship between nature and emotion, seeking to evoke a feeling of <em>energising calm</em>.</p>
      <p class="reveal">Influenced by the rolling countryside, farms and meadows of my upbringing in Britain, alongside the vibrant tropical botanicals of Singapore where I am currently based, my work draws upon the contrasting environments I have called home.</p>
      <p class="reveal">These surroundings, together with the places and landscapes encountered through travel, continue to shape my artistic practice and inspire the forms, colours and compositions within my paintings.</p>

